      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is apparently already a thing, but it's quite annoying to get to as you need to:\n\n1. Click on the 3 dots\n\n2. Click on \"View Instance\"\n\n3. And then finally click on Preload World\n\nDoing so also still leaves the Invite sitting there, so you also need to manually decline it.\n\nI feel like this should really be improved as described in my canny above, cause this is wayyyy more annoying than it needs to be.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
