  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-09-20T19:17:01.297Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nRight now when you get an Invite you can't also Preload the World before joining, which is quite annoying, as invites are often used to get from one place to another.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nAdd a \"Preload World\" button to Invite Notifications.  \n\nPressing this button should remove the Invite and start the Preload process, so that you can join once it's done.",
